                      <td valign="top" height="100%"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2" color="midnightblue"><span class="spnMessageText" id="msg"> Question...even though I am not a cleric <img src="http://www.eciunbroken.com/forums/images/icon_smile.gif" border="0" alt="" title="" align="middle" /><br /><br />I am not all that familiar with CH cycles; only in theory.<br /><br />However, the answer may apply to someone else as well.<br /><br />Since the clerics are in 3-5 person CH cycles, are they all in the same group, or just on a common heal channel?  If they are simply in a heal channel, do we utilize multiple heal channels for different CH cycles in large raids (or does that ever even happen?  Seems to me that at some point it would have to.)?<br /><br />Also, for you DRUIDS out there - we get two baby-CH spells: Tunare's Renewal and Karana's Renewal; one at lvl 58 and the other at lvl 64.<br /><br />Personally, I don't know why Tunare's heal is weaker - maybe it's because that silly Karana is such a wuss <img src="http://www.eciunbroken.com/forums/images/icon_smile_tongue.gif" border="0" alt="" title="" align="middle" /></span id="msg"></font><br><br></td>
