                      <td valign="top" height="100%"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2" color="midnightblue"><span class="spnMessageText" id="msg"> CH chains are tricky if u have 2-4 clerics in a chain remmeber that the mob yer fighting (if u have that many clerics on a chain) DOES rampage. this means u have to have a rampage tank. the way i have seen the rampage tank work and work efficently is have the MT call assist to your ramp tank the ramp tank calls assist for the rest of the raid. with that being raid a mob on rampage would kill a MT quickly the ramp tank is there to absorb this dmg. this is where druids become totally necessary. ok lets put it into very simple terms with guildies as examples.<br /><br />MT belkisha<br />ST divin<br />3T kashek<br /><br />Rampage tank Macmo<br /><br /><br />belkisha would attack and get decent agro call assist to mac .. macmo attacks and calls assist to raid. this isnt a huge amount of time the rampage tank just has to be the next person on the hate list.<br /><br /><br />engage mob with clerics and druids doin quick heals complete helas on MT.<br /><br />the mob rampages .. ALL melee but MT Rampage tank STOP attacking. <br /><br />now the CH QH chain has been directed at the MT the entier fight to this point. when the rage message shows u would split healers clerics on MT and if u had enough a couple droods throwing fast heals. <br />the rest of the healers switch to rampage tank this switch from MT to ramp tank is VITAL. it requires the droods to make a target hot key to make the switch smooth. when the mob stops rampage everyone can attack again and droods can switch back to fast heals on the MT. THIS rampage CAN and WILL happen several times during fights so u cant be sleeping.<br /><br />RAIDS ARE ALL ABOUT AGRO CONTROL. if u cant control your agro on a mob then u need to ask about spells research etc. find out what u can do different to change your control problem. All it takes is for 1-2 ppl to go nuke happy or taunt and keep attacking to make a simple thing into a giant corpse retrievel. think AGRO CONTROL its the difference between a public throw together raid and a real raid.<br /><br />hope this answered the question.<br />heath<br /></span id="msg"></font><br><br></td>
                    </tr>
